Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago, an already extraordinary\Nman wished for further power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man could soar like\Na bird, swim like a fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,breathe like a tree, and\Nmove like a winding stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sunlight spelled his doom,\Nso he created a stone mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, he would face\Nthe sun without fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, the world would be his.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.01,0:00:38.02,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx90\pos(1290,865)\fad(0,650)\blur1}Episode 26: "A Man Turned God" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 25 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.01,0:00:38.02,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx(82)\pos(1290,865)\fad(0,650)}Episode 26: "The Man Who Became A God" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 25 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vertigo, please tell me\Ncars fell into the lava.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must create armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like a clam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:00:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a crab, a bony shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, make me impervious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dummy, that's lava!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a thousand degrees in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now burn to a crisp, you cocky bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars was the last of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pillar Men are defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shock of his demise\Ntriggered an eruption!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to safety before we\Ncelebrate further! Good call!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight, alright?
