Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You perform that aria perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've so longed to hear you sing it, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars, you're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bit of his shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inorganic, but of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars first covered himself in a\Nsubstance, not unlike a crab shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it was still organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't up to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faced with the heat of the\Nlava, it burned away instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily for Kars, he had the idea\Nto create a second layer of armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made of an unlikely\Nsubstance, mere air bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bubbles maintained a pocket of air\Nbetween Kars' body and the lethal heat.
