Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the outer layer burned\Naway with each passing second,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But more bubbles worked their\Nway outward to replace them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maintaining a perfect equilibrium.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.18,0:03:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars had the moments he needed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Earth gave birth to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,horror of horrors, Kars, a creature of the\NEarth, has conquered the planet itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eons ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long before man first thought to\Nchronicle his deeds, A group of creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like us but not, evolved\Nalongside humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun was lethal to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they lived out their\Nlives under the cool
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,glow of the moon and in\Ntheir subterranean cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even without the sun's sustaining rays,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they endured far longer than their human\Nrivals by feeding on other living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To humans that knew of their existence,\Nthey were revered as gods or demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their numbers were small, as\Nfew died and children were rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all things, they\Nmaintained a vital balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They knew no strife and lived\Nin peace with one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, a man of great pride\Nand ambition was born among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strength is hidden within this body,\Ntalents we cannot but dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall be the one to unlock them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To that end, he created a stone mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mask granted him unheralded power,\Nbut at a terrible, ravenous cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To survive, he had to consume\Nlife at a dizzying rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If left unchecked, he would eventually\Ndevour every living thing on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His brethren began to fear the mask, as\Nwell as the gifted soul who created it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His very existence is a threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no place for one\Nsuch as him in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to wipe out his evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.80,0:05:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to have\Ndominion over the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To stand in ascendance over all life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To purge your fears and\Nreign forever as gods?
