Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even killing the parents\Nwho had given him life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and his sole ally\Ntook the two surviving
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,infants and left the scene of the carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They set off in search of ultimate power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a journey of continents\Nand centuries alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, 10,000 years later, that\Npower was in his hands at last.
