Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and against such a foe\Nthere is nothing that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can do we must submit
