Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg, it's melting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Melting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Denial will get you nowhere, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I conquered the sun itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that something\Nlike Hamon was somehow beyond my reach?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is Hamon at my disposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems that mine is\Nhundreds of times more potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's much stronger than Jojo's!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as though he brushed\Nhis knee against the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His flesh is liquefying and\Nvaporizing before his very eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder, how do you like the\Ntaste of your own medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a very articulate reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's time to put\Nyou out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo accepted his impending demise calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He felt no fear, no pain,\Nno regret at his plight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did all I could, he told himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the epitome of evil\Nloomed over Jojo in triumph,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he watched his dying self\Nwith perfect clarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroheim felt much the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:09:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unable to move, he knew what snake prey\Nfeels like as it stares into Oblivion's maw.
