Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power in a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think I will annihilate a practitioner\Nof Hamon with his own discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you can appreciate\Nthe irony in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha... more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.82,0:09:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stronger than mine has ever been.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me be the first to\Nwelcome you into oblivion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Harmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the red stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the red stone?
