Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Red Stone of Asia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why did Jojo brandish it\Nat Kars in that final moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even he had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if by instinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he lunged the stone towards the\Napproaching Hamon to which it gravitated.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:13.93,0:10:19.14,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Sai! Wa nagerareta susumu shikanai
