Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo's body did the one thing\Nthat could save his life!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.85,0:10:26.44,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kimyo na rasen no naka korogaritsuzukeru
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.85,0:10:26.44,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The eternally-wandering adventurer
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having survived Karr's coup d'Atta,\Nhis will to live sprang into action.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.44,0:10:31.86,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Eien wo samayo bokensha
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.44,0:10:31.86,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Tumbles through a bizarre spiral
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the red stone amplifies Hamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fueled by the magnified blast of Hamon,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.28,0:10:42.91,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kyofu wo mitome tatsu mono ni ogon no tamashi wo
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.28,0:10:42.91,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A golden soul for the man who conquers his fears
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the volcano's fury reaches\Nthe breaking point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It erupts!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.91,0:10:49.04,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Soshite deatta futari no tame ni
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.91,0:10:49.04,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The two who met under fate...
