Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.46,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Tatakai wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.46,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've blasted into the sky!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.30,0:11:01.18,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Maku ga aita you na owarinaki monogatari
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.30,0:11:01.18,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The curtain rises on an endless tale
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The force is strong, like\Nnothing I've ever known!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.18,0:11:04.52,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Inochi ga butsukaru hibana
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.18,0:11:04.52,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let the sparks as lives clash cast light
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.98,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Seishun no hibi wo terase yo
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.98,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}On the days of their youth
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a little eruption\Nwill be enough to conquer the likes of me?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.98,0:11:14.65,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kimi to iu mirai ni koun wo
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.98,0:11:14.65,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}May fortune shine on the future you bring!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just fly my way to safety.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.65,0:11:18.66,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.65,0:11:18.66,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.28,0:11:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the fruits of your folly, Jojo!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.66,0:11:22.45,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}JoJo!
