Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's laughing now, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.79,0:11:36.72,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Nidoto hodokenai karamiatta sadame
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.79,0:11:36.72,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Two fates knot into one inseparably
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna say, did you\Nplan this too, Jojo? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you always know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a moment, Kars was distracted by\NJojo's arm and his cocky attitude.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.55,0:11:47.56,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Subete wa koko kara hajimatteita no sa!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.55,0:11:47.56,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}It all began at that moment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That moment was all it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scalding rocks he didn't see coming launched\Nhim even higher into the stratosphere!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.02,0:11:53.90,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Furueru hodo kokoro moetsukiru hodo atsuku
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.02,0:11:53.90,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let that burning in your soul calm the trembling of your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you plan this too, Jojo? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you even asking?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.90,0:11:57.20,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sono te kara hanate kodou
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.90,0:11:57.20,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Strike down your fears,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I set the trap and you\Nwalked right into it!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.20,0:12:00.66,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Karada minagiru yuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.20,0:12:00.66,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}With courage coursing through your veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of this went down like clockwork!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.66,0:12:05.08,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Mayoi naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.66,0:12:05.08,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Bravely embrace your fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got lucky, but thinking I\Noutsmarted him will drive cars nuts!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.50,0:12:10.38,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Maku ga aita you na owarinaki monogatari
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.50,0:12:10.38,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The curtain rises on an endless tale
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that moment,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.38,0:12:13.71,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Inochi ga butsukaru hibana
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.38,0:12:13.71,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let the sparks as lives clash cast light
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rocks launched by the volcano's\Neruption reached escape velocity.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.71,0:12:17.17,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Seishun no hibi wo terase yo
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.71,0:12:17.17,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}On the days of their youth
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kars was the perfect being!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.17,0:12:23.47,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Kimi to iu mirai ni koun wo
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.17,0:12:23.47,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}May fortune shine on the future you bring!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing on Earth could kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, just then, he was blasted\Ninto the vacuum of space!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.72,0:12:27.02,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.72,0:12:27.02,Insert Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.85,0:12:34.98,Insert Jap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Granny, and Stroheim, old Speedwagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoky, and Lisa Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Von Stroheim made it back to\Nthe others eight hours later,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whereupon he told them this sad news.
