Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just find the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use air to change my trajectory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I'm back on solid ground,\NI will tear that boy apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:13:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:13:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air is freezing around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment it comes out of the jets!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turns to ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't change my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
