Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last and greatest of the Pillar Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body turned hard as rock, and he\Nfloated through space for the rest of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wished for death, but there\Nwas nothing out there to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.66,0:14:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spark of thought within\Nhim went dim, and then silent.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.62,0:14:55.50,Title2.1,Unknown,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,700)\pos(960,841)\bord3\blur2}Outside New York City, April 1939
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.62,0:14:55.50,Title2,Unknown,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,700)\pos(960,841)\be(2)}Outside New York City, April 1939
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We commend his soul unto the\Nheavenly father. Though his life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on earth has ended far too\Nsoon he lives in grace with you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,comfort those he leaves behind Oh\NGod and let them know your peace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Jojo I didn't know you for too\Nlong couldn't have been more than six months
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't matter even though\Nyou're gone I'm your friend
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forever
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't do to catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally make it to New York, and\Nnobody was there to pick me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, I got word you were all at a\Nfuneral, so I decided to crash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lisa Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess you healed up pretty well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Messina, good to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New hand works well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I've been meaning\Nto ask Stroheim if he can
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,jazz it up with a few\Ngadgets or tools or whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's right out\Nwith us fighting Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You leave these mourners alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect, you own...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so I'm oaf, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a lesson in manners,\Nand I'm glad to apply!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.90,0:16:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you didn't mean\Nnothing by it. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you, big\Nguy! You'd better...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to catch up\Nwith my family and friends.
