Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, breaking the leg, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should watch where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want a\Nbroken bone at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How careless of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is a case\Nof live and learn. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.68,0:20:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Japanese, aren't\Nyou? I am. Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, watch your damn bag!
