Dialogue: 2,0:20:51.65,0:20:55.65,Main,Announcement,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8\fs53}Alitalia flight 285 for Tokyo is now boarding.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.65,0:21:02.95,Main,Announcement,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8\fs53}I repeat. Alitalia flight 285 for Tokyo is now boarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:21:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only daughter has been married\Nto a Japanese man for over 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fell in love on the other side of\Nthe world and never came home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her son rarely gets to\Nsee his own grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'll never\Nforgive the Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, they make\Nsome rather nifty gadgets.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.60,0:21:36.07,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.60,0:21:36.07,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.69,0:21:39.90,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.69,0:21:39.90,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.90,0:21:43.28,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.90,0:21:43.28,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:21:43.28,0:21:50.54,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.28,0:21:50.54,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.29,0:21:57.09,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.29,0:21:57.09,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.29,0:21:57.09,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.09,0:22:05.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.09,0:22:05.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.80,0:22:11.89,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.80,0:22:11.89,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.69,0:22:18.53,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.69,0:22:18.53,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true. We're gonna\Nget Yasura no Seiko o tsuka!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.53,0:22:22.36,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.53,0:22:22.36,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.20,0:22:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dario ni ta omoi ga, Mariah no Cairo ko?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.36,0:22:27.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.36,0:22:27.78,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.62,0:22:30.87,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.62,0:22:30.87,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a burning stone,\Nhot-suk like a burning stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.12,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.12,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.12,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.87,0:22:33.12,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.12,0:22:36.96,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.12,0:22:36.96,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ketsu Mega ni kizamareta yunan ni.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uki no ni kei wa koi no kizuna.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.96,0:22:42.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.96,0:22:42.76,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.76,0:22:47.72,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.76,0:22:47.72,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Niigiri shimete.
